# Claude Debussy -- Arabesque No. 1 in E major, L. 66 (1888). Public domain.
# Converted from assets/midi_files/debussy_Arabesque_1.mid, bars 1-12.
#
# The opening arpeggio wave, then the theme enters over it. The hardest score
# here: the two staves run 3:2 against each other and almost never land
# together, so the reconstruction has to hold two unrelated fits in the air at
# once -- and each triplet gets a third of a beat to establish itself before
# the next one takes over.
#
# Converted mechanically by score_from_midi.py -- not transcribed by ear.

